ZCL_COMMAND_READY_COMMAND(
    "zcode.reward.commit", "zcode.reward", "",
    "Settle a planned batch (SIMULATED, idempotent)",
    "Settles one planned window batch SIMULATED under the placeholder "
    "token id: re-validates every planned row against the CURRENT "
    "reward-history ledger (staleness, duplicate-reward, exact cap "
    "recomputation), writes durable ledger facts (what the period caps "
    "read), transitions the queue records, and writes the commit record "
    "LAST — the idempotence authority. Replay-safe: a crash between commit "
    "and ledger write leaves a resumable partial state (resumed:true on "
    "the finishing commit); re-settling the same plan id is rejected as "
    "ALREADY_SETTLED — a duplicate, never a double-pay. UNKNOWN_PLAN, "
    "STALE_PLAN, and CAPS_CHANGED name the other rejections. No ZSLP "
    "transfer exists: the receipt is the evidence for the future "
    "owner-reviewed slice-14 send.",
