    "root-committed manifest BEFORE it is stored (the authentication), "
    "with bounded attempts naming a terminal failure. Against a running "
    "-packagehost=1 node this drives the live engine (live:true); a "
    "one-shot CLI persists the resumable record under "
    "<datadir>/zcode/downloads/<root-hex> and reports live:false — the "
    "next hosting boot resumes it. ALREADY_COMPLETE (already_complete:"
    "true) is the idempotent redelivery. Rejections name the rule: "
    "BAD_ROOT, NO_STORE, DOWNLOAD_SLOTS_FULL (16 tracked downloads), "
    "RECORD_IO. `day` pins the accounting window for deterministic "
    "testing (host clock when omitted).",
    0,
    "zcode,package,fetch,download,swarm,resume",
    "zcl.zcode_package_fetch.input.v1", "zcl.zcode_package_fetch.v1",
    "root,day,datadir", "root",
